  "statement": {
    "title": "Unused zero gradients ignore the graph-construction option",
    "body": "When unused inputs are permitted and zero gradients are requested for them, torch gradient computation returns an unused input's zero result with requires_grad=True even when graph construction is disabled. Used and unused results must both be detached when graph construction is disabled and graph-tracked only when enabled.",
